#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/x_src2.xml
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	data
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Concise
#Data requested:	Domain hits and site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: NO
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#DOMAINS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<hit-type>	<PSSM-ID>	<from>	<to>	<E-Value>	<bitscore>	<accession>	<short-name>	<incomplete>	<superfamily PSSM-ID>
#more such lines......
#ENDDOMAINS
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	RPSBLAST 2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	206	NP_417755.1 30S ribosomal subunit protein S4 [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_1	Specific	440288	1	206	1.46341e-134	375.182	COG0522	RpsD	-	-
ENDDOMAINS
SITES
1	Query_1	Specific	RNA binding surface	R97,A109,T110,A112,E113,R115,Q116,S119,H120,A122,V129,V130,N131,I132,A133,S134,Y135,Q136,S138	19	19	238095
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_2	Peptide	140	NP_415914.1 phenylacetyl-CoA thioesterase [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_2	Specific	131339	19	132	5.5444e-60	180.694	TIGR02286	PaaD	-	529137
ENDDOMAINS
SITES
1	Query_2	Specific	CoenzymeA binding site	C51,A77,F84,L85,R86,P87	6	6	239527
1	Query_2	Specific	PHB binding site	G53,D61,T62,A65,Y66,A77	6	6	239527
1	Query_2	Specific	subunit interaction site	H52,G54,F57,S78,A79,C80,T81,I82,F84	9	9	239527
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
